# Project requirements (docs/requirements/ only — never cite templates here):
# - requirement-shell-cli-interface.md
# - requirement-shell-cli-self-install.md    (self-install; $0 copy vs download; dest 0755/0700)
# - requirement-shell-cli-zero-arguments.md  (TTY empty argv = menu; off-TTY Type O ensure)
# - requirement-shell-cli-default-interaction.md (numbered menu; 8 self-management)
# - requirement-shell-cli-storage.md         (util_resolve_storage + about fields)
